name:General Store
graphics:1:U
priority:20
flags:SHOP | LOS | PROJECT | PASSABLE | PERMANENT | INTERESTING | EASY
look-prefix:the entrance to the
look-in-preposition:at
desc:The General Store sells food, ammunition and lighting supplies.

