graphics:#:W
priority:10
flags:WALL | ROCK | GRANITE | NO_SCENT | NO_FLOW | TORCH
digging:4
confused-msg:bashes into a wall
desc:A seam of hard rock.  It can be removed by digging or magic, and passed
